        <col>Special Features - Used Books - Fiction - General Special Features - Used Books - Science Fiction &amp; Fantasy - Authors, A-Z - ( J ) Subjects - Fiction - General Subjects - Science Fiction &amp; Fantasy - Authors, A-Z - J - Jordan, Robert</col>
      </line>
