nt-style:italic;"&gt;Test-Driven iOS Development&lt;/span&gt; covers both essential&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;concepts &lt;span style="font-style:italic;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; practical implementation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
