        <col>Special Features - Used Books - Crime, Thrillers &amp; Mystery - Authors, A-Z - ( B ) Subjects - Crime, Thrillers &amp; Mystery - Authors, A-Z - B - Brookmyre, Christopher Subjects - Crime, Thrillers &amp; Mystery - Mystery - General Subjects - Fiction - Authors, A-Z - B - Brookmyre, Christopher Subjects - Fiction - Contemporary Fiction: 1970 Onwards - General Subjects - Fiction - General</col>
      </line>
