d out, forces are being gathered. The powerful and reclusive slumlord, Elijah, starts a chain of events which will swallow everyone in the city - Citizen and undesirable alike.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stuck in the middle, Kaylee and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
