        <col>15 - Fiction Special Features - Used Books - Fiction - Authors, A-Z - ( C ) Special Features - Used Books - Fiction - Contemporary Fiction: 1970 Onwards - General Special Features - Used Books - Fiction - Contemporary Fiction: 1970 Onwards - Literary Fiction Special Features - Used Books - Fiction - Contemporary Fiction: 1970 Onwards - Popular Fiction Special Features - Used Books - Fiction - Cult Authors Subjects - Fiction - Authors, A-Z - C - Coupland, Douglas Subjects - Fiction - By Period - General Subjects - Fiction - Contemporary Fiction: 1970 Onwards - Literary Fiction</col>
