        <col>Special Features - Used Books - Children's Books - Ages 5-8 - Authors Special Features - Used Books - Children's Books - Ages 9-11 - Authors Special Features - Used Books - Children's Books - Ages 9-11 - Characters &amp; Series Special Features - Used Books - Children's Books - Fiction - General Special Features - Used Books - Children's Books - Fiction - Science Fiction &amp; Fantasy Special Features - Used Books - Young Adult - Science Fiction &amp; Fantasy Subjects - Children's Books - Ages 5-8 - Authors - Rowling, JK Subjects - Children's Books - Ages 9-11 - Authors - Rowling, JK Subjects - Children's Books - Ages 9-11 - Characters &amp; Series - Harry Potter - Complete List Subjects - Children's Books - Ages 9-11 - Characters &amp; Series - Harry Potter - Paperbacks</col>
